    "content": {
     "content_type": "text",
     "parts": [
      "Box 12 code **DD** is the cost of employer-sponsored health coverage (both your share and the employer's share). It's informational only. It doesn't change your taxable income or your tax due, and you don't need to do anything with it on your return beyond entering it if the software asks."
     ]
