    "content": {
     "content_type": "text",
     "parts": [
      "Code **W** is employer contributions to your Health Savings Account (including any pre-tax contributions you made through payroll). It *is* relevant: it goes on Form 8889 (HSA). Your tax software will ask for it and handle it. Those contributions are generally excluded from income if you were HSA-eligible."
     ]
    },
